/*
 * Starting HP table. Use for testing. Applied once when the unit is loaded.
 * Each entry is: character ID, HP (1-254). Character ID 0 ends the list.
 * Edit these bytes without rebuilding C. Common IDs: Eirika $01, Seth $02, Ephraim $0F.
 */
 ALIGN 4
 ExpandedHpTestUnits:
 BYTE $01 200 // Eirika
 BYTE $00 $00